{%- comment -%}
  Every mattress variant as JSON, including price 0, inventory 0, and
  US/AU/UAE titles.   SIZE_MAPS is not a live ceiling. The picker and size
  guide share filterCatalogRows: Market Shown (custom.MarketShown) for the
  browser country. Multi-country values (GB • US) tokenize as a set.
  If that country is not a defined Market Shown market (Ghana / GH), both
  pages use the UK/GB set. Classic 7 only if the filtered set is empty.
  Blank Market Shown is not all 18.
  Expects: mattress (product)
{%- endcomment -%}
[
{%- assign catalog_first = true -%}
{%- if mattress != blank -%}
  {%- for v in mattress.variants -%}
    {%- unless catalog_first -%},{%- endunless -%}
    {%- render 'size-variant-json', v: v -%}
    {%- assign catalog_first = false -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
]
